  "description": "UltraSecureWatcher is a high-performance anti-cheat and anti-debug monitoring engine for .NET applications.\n\t\t\tIt provides advanced runtime protection by detecting:\n\t\t\t- DLL injection\n\t\t\t- Debuggers (local and remote)\n\t\t\t- Hooking tools (e.g., EasyHook, Detours)\n\t\t\t- Memory tampering\n\t\t\t- Mapped/injected modules\n\t\t\t- Blacklisted hacking tools\n\t\t\t- System file tampering\n\t\t\t- Parent process spoofing\n\t\t\t- Virtual machines and sandbox environments\n\n\t\t\tIt automatically logs violations, captures screenshots, sends webhook alerts to Discord, and forcefully terminates the app when threats are found.\n\n\t\t\tPerfect for games, license-protected apps, and enterprise-grade security solutions.",
